        "content": "## ATES Jarvis - Sales Slice (WIRED skeleton)\n**Real MongoDB/HTTP nodes pre-placed.** To make it run:\n1. Create 3 credentials (see note below).\n2. Run `aaziko/scripts/aaziko-discover.js` -> confirm the field names.\n3. Fix the query filters marked (field TODO), then Execute.\nReads are READ-ONLY + bounded. Writes go ONLY to `aaziko_jarvis`.",
